{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"(∞,n)-范畴"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"∞-n-范畴"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>$(\\infty,n)$-范畴是具有至多 $n$ 阶不可逆态射的"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶范畴","text":"高阶范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>一般而言, 定义 $(\\infty,n)$-范畴有两条路线:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一是"},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"表现"}},{"Plain":", 即用基本对象和运算 (见"},{"Local":{"url":"代数模式","text":"代数模式"}},{"Plain":") 来"},{"Local":{"url":"探测","text":"探测"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>二是"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴","text":"充实"}},{"Plain":", 即 $n$-范畴充实于 $(n-1)$-范畴.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对 $(\\infty,n)$-范畴的概念取某种极限可得 "},{"Local":{"url":"∞-∞-范畴","text":"$(\\infty,\\infty)$-范畴"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>作为 $n$ 重 Segal 生象</h3>\n<h3>作为 $\\Theta_n$-空间</h3>\n<p>$(\\infty,n)$-范畴的一种定义是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Θ-n-空间","text":"$\\Theta_n$-空间"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h3>作为充实范畴</h3>\n<p>$(\\infty,n)$-范畴可归纳地定义为"},{"Local":{"url":"充实范畴","text":"充实"}},{"Plain":"于 $(\\infty,n-1)$-范畴的范畴:\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Cat}_{(\\infty ,n+1)} := \\mathsf{Cat}_{(\\infty,n)}\\text{-}\\mathsf{Cat}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}